{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0114L863EVJTQ4smJRRS4YzP","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — gated_mfrm_judge_bias\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\t- Primary: AAAI 2027 (full paper, deadline July 28, 2026)\n5\t- Backup: ACL 2027 via ARR (submission August 3, 2026)\n6\t- Timeline: ~68 days from today (2026-05-21)\n7\t\n8\t## Core Insight\n9\tSequential approaches to judge bias correction and contamination adjustment produce biased model ability estimates due to omitted variable confounding. Joint estimation within a single psychometric calibration framework is methodologically necessary, not merely convenient.\n10\t\n11\t## Core Claims (3 条，均可证伪)\n12\t\n13\t1. **Confounding Claim**: When judge severity (d_j) and contamination susceptibility (c_n·e_i) are both present but only one is modeled, the unmodeled facet's effect is absorbed into other parameter estimates, producing systematic bias in model ability rankings. Sequential pipelines (bias-first or contamination-first) do not resolve this confounding.\n14\t\n15\t2. **Framework Claim**: The Gated Many-Facet Rasch Model (G-MFRM) — combining MFRM's multi-facet structure with DG-IRT's gating mechanism and externally-anchored exposure indicators — jointly estimates model ability, item difficulty, judge severity, and contamination susceptibility in a single calibration, yielding bias-and-contamination-corrected \"fair scores.\"\n16\t\n17\t3. **Empirical Claim**: G-MFRM fair scores achieve higher agreement with human rankings (Chatbot Arena votes, Kendall-τ) than all baselines: raw multi-judge averages, bias-only correction (CyclicJudge, UDA), contamination-only adjustment (DCR), and naive sequential pipelines.\n18\t\n19\t## Story Spine\n20\t\n21\t- **Problem**: LLM-as-a-judge evaluation has bifurcated into two correction silos — judge bias and benchmark contamination — that are addressed independently. But judge severity and contamination effects are confounded: bias-only methods absorb contamination inflation into ability estimates; contamination-only methods misattribute judge effects as contamination signals. Sequential correction cannot resolve this because the first stage's estimates are already biased by the unmodeled facet.\n22\t\n23\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: CyclicJudge eliminates average judge bias via round-robin but ignores contamination. UDA uses neural K-factor adjustment (−63.4% inter-judge std) but is black-box and contamination-unaware. DCR/ConStat quantify contamination effects (r²=0.94) but ignore judge variation. No existing work (0/12 surveyed papers, through May 2026) jointly models both within a single calibration framework.\n24\t\n25\t- **Our framing**: Joint estimation is methodologically necessary. We formalize this as an omitted variable bias problem: under non-orthogonality of d_j and c_n·e_i, sequential estimators are asymptotically biased (direction determined by covariance sign). G-MFRM resolves this by estimating all facets simultaneously, with a three-stage procedure ensuring identifiability: (1) standard MFRM for initial estimates, (2) external exposure anchoring via ConStat + temporal signals, (3) joint gated model with c_n as latent parameters.\n26\t\n27\t- **Headline result template**: \"On MT-Bench/Arena-Hard with 8 LLM judges, G-MFRM fair scores achieve X% higher Kendall-τ with Chatbot Arena human votes than the best sequential baseline, while simultaneously producing interpretable per-model contamination estimates and per-judge severity profiles.\"\n28\t\n29\t## Narrative Strategy (from distilled writing)\n30\t\n31\t- **Type**: \"突破局限\" (sequential has structural flaw) + \"统一框架\" (G-MFRM unifies both corrections)\n32\t- **Opening hook**: Quantitative shock — lead with confounding's θ-RMSE degradation (43.8% in synthetic, to be validated on real data)\n33\t- **Section 2**: Toy example / formal proposition demonstrating confounding before introducing G-MFRM method\n34\t- **Figure 1**: Left = sequential pipeline with confounding annotation, Right = joint G-MFRM with gating mechanism highlighted\n35\t- **Main result table**: rows = methods (7 baselines + G-MFRM), cols = benchmarks × metrics\n36\t- **Ablation**: Full numbers (not checkmark grid), rows = components on/off\n37\t\n38\t## Venue Fit Risks\n39\t\n40\t- **AAAI**: Good fit for psychometric methodology applied to AI evaluation. Risk: reviewers may lack MFRM/IRT background — need clear, self-contained exposition with toy examples. Strength: AAAI values formal modeling + practical impact.\n41\t- **ACL/ARR**: Good fit for LLM evaluation methodology. Risk: may demand stronger NLP-specific contributions beyond the measurement framework. Strength: directly relevant to LLM evaluation community.\n42\t\n43\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n44\t\n45\t1. **\"Why not CyclicJudge + discard contaminated items?\"** — Item discard wastes information; CyclicJudge doesn't capture item-specific judge effects; neither produces c_n for auditing; G-MFRM degrades gracefully to standard MFRM when contamination ≈ 0.\n46\t\n47\t2. **\"Is confounding large enough in practice?\"** — MVP synthetic: 43.8% RMSE degradation. Real-data calibration (P0 experiment) will establish realistic contamination magnitude. Bias scatter (r=0.65) shows the mechanism exists regardless of magnitude.\n48\t\n49\t3. **\"Rank-1 assumption (c_n·e_i) too strong\"** — Rank-1 is LLTM tradition, good approximation when contamination comes from dominant data source. Person-fit diagnostics (infit/outfit) detect violations. Rank-k extension is future work.\n50\t\n51\t4. **\"DG-IRT transfer is trivial\"** — Three structural differences require non-trivial adaptation: binary→continuous exposure, single-rater→multi-facet, known→unknown exposure status. Stage 2 external anchoring solves a fundamental obstacle (exposure unknown to administrator) absent in educational testing.\n52\t\n53\t5. **\"Contamination signal realistic?\"** — ConStat validated r²=0.94 with true contamination effects. LogProber provides per-item memorization indicators. Multiple indicators combined via weighted composite. P0 experiment calibrates against real benchmarks.\n54\t\n55\t## MVP Evidence Summary\n56\t\n57\t- mvp_003: Joint RMSE −43.8% vs Sequential (p=1e-6), Kendall-τ +6.3pp, R̂=1.03, ESS=224\n58\t- Bias scatter: Pearson r=0.65 (sequential systematically overestimates high-c_n models)\n59\t- Robustness: method effective even under model misspecification (DGP with s_j, model without)\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a57f7a91-5608-4b5c-b6a3-f3e4a88c0472","uuid":"f2cf7bde-2add-4b97-a6ab-124a5be18f35","timestamp":"2026-05-21T21:06:59.047Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod43/projects/gated_mfrm_judge_bias/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T204917/median/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — gated_mfrm_judge_bias\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: AAAI 2027 (full paper, deadline July 28, 2026)\n- Backup: ACL 2027 via ARR (submission August 3, 2026)\n- Timeline: ~68 days from today (2026-05-21)\n\n## Core Insight\nSequential approaches to judge bias correction and contamination adjustment produce biased model ability estimates due to omitted variable confounding. Joint estimation within a single psychometric calibration framework is methodologically necessary, not merely convenient.\n\n## Core Claims (3 条，均可证伪)\n\n1. **Confounding Claim**: When judge severity (d_j) and contamination susceptibility (c_n·e_i) are both present but only one is modeled, the unmodeled facet's effect is absorbed into other parameter estimates, producing systematic bias in model ability rankings. Sequential pipelines (bias-first or contamination-first) do not resolve this confounding.\n\n2. **Framework Claim**: The Gated Many-Facet Rasch Model (G-MFRM) — combining MFRM's multi-facet structure with DG-IRT's gating mechanism and externally-anchored exposure indicators — jointly estimates model ability, item difficulty, judge severity, and contamination susceptibility in a single calibration, yielding bias-and-contamination-corrected \"fair scores.\"\n\n3. **Empirical Claim**: G-MFRM fair scores achieve higher agreement with human rankings (Chatbot Arena votes, Kendall-τ) than all baselines: raw multi-judge averages, bias-only correction (CyclicJudge, UDA), contamination-only adjustment (DCR), and naive sequential pipelines.\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: LLM-as-a-judge evaluation has bifurcated into two correction silos — judge bias and benchmark contamination — that are addressed independently. But judge severity and contamination effects are confounded: bias-only methods absorb contamination inflation into ability estimates; contamination-only methods misattribute judge effects as contamination signals. Sequential correction cannot resolve this because the first stage's estimates are already biased by the unmodeled facet.\n\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: CyclicJudge eliminates average judge bias via round-robin but ignores contamination. UDA uses neural K-factor adjustment (−63.4% inter-judge std) but is black-box and contamination-unaware. DCR/ConStat quantify contamination effects (r²=0.94) but ignore judge variation. No existing work (0/12 surveyed papers, through May 2026) jointly models both within a single calibration framework.\n\n- **Our framing**: Joint estimation is methodologically necessary. We formalize this as an omitted variable bias problem: under non-orthogonality of d_j and c_n·e_i, sequential estimators are asymptotically biased (direction determined by covariance sign). G-MFRM resolves this by estimating all facets simultaneously, with a three-stage procedure ensuring identifiability: (1) standard MFRM for initial estimates, (2) external exposure anchoring via ConStat + temporal signals, (3) joint gated model with c_n as latent parameters.\n\n- **Headline result template**: \"On MT-Bench/Arena-Hard with 8 LLM judges, G-MFRM fair scores achieve X% higher Kendall-τ with Chatbot Arena human votes than the best sequential baseline, while simultaneously producing interpretable per-model contamination estimates and per-judge severity profiles.\"\n\n## Narrative Strategy (from distilled writing)\n\n- **Type**: \"突破局限\" (sequential has structural flaw) + \"统一框架\" (G-MFRM unifies both corrections)\n- **Opening hook**: Quantitative shock — lead with confounding's θ-RMSE degradation (43.8% in synthetic, to be validated on real data)\n- **Section 2**: Toy example / formal proposition demonstrating confounding before introducing G-MFRM method\n- **Figure 1**: Left = sequential pipeline with confounding annotation, Right = joint G-MFRM with gating mechanism highlighted\n- **Main result table**: rows = methods (7 baselines + G-MFRM), cols = benchmarks × metrics\n- **Ablation**: Full numbers (not checkmark grid), rows = components on/off\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n\n- **AAAI**: Good fit for psychometric methodology applied to AI evaluation. Risk: reviewers may lack MFRM/IRT background — need clear, self-contained exposition with toy examples. Strength: AAAI values formal modeling + practical impact.\n- **ACL/ARR**: Good fit for LLM evaluation methodology. Risk: may demand stronger NLP-specific contributions beyond the measurement framework. Strength: directly relevant to LLM evaluation community.\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\n\n1. **\"Why not CyclicJudge + discard contaminated items?\"** — Item discard wastes information; CyclicJudge doesn't capture item-specific judge effects; neither produces c_n for auditing; G-MFRM degrades gracefully to standard MFRM when contamination ≈ 0.\n\n2. **\"Is confounding large enough in practice?\"** — MVP synthetic: 43.8% RMSE degradation. Real-data calibration (P0 experiment) will establish realistic contamination magnitude. Bias scatter (r=0.65) shows the mechanism exists regardless of magnitude.\n\n3. **\"Rank-1 assumption (c_n·e_i) too strong\"** — Rank-1 is LLTM tradition, good approximation when contamination comes from dominant data source. Person-fit diagnostics (infit/outfit) detect violations. Rank-k extension is future work.\n\n4. **\"DG-IRT transfer is trivial\"** — Three structural differences require non-trivial adaptation: binary→continuous exposure, single-rater→multi-facet, known→unknown exposure status. Stage 2 external anchoring solves a fundamental obstacle (exposure unknown to administrator) absent in educational testing.\n\n5. **\"Contamination signal realistic?\"** — ConStat validated r²=0.94 with true contamination effects. LogProber provides per-item memorization indicators. Multiple indicators combined via weighted composite. P0 experiment calibrates against real benchmarks.\n\n## MVP Evidence Summary\n\n- mvp_003: Joint RMSE −43.8% vs Sequential (p=1e-6), Kendall-τ +6.3pp, R̂=1.03, ESS=224\n- Bias scatter: Pearson r=0.65 (sequential systematically overestimates high-c_n models)\n- Robustness: method effective even under model misspecification (DGP with s_j, model without)\n","numLines":60,"startLine":1,"totalLines":60}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019A5GSNmQLKXjCuoVgRPc2o","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"multi_judge_data_collection\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"8个judge（GPT-5.5, Claude Opus 4.7, Claude Sonnet 4.6, DeepSeek-V4-Pro, Qwen3-235B-A22B, Qwen3.6-27B, Llama 4 Maverick, Gemini 2.5 Pro） 在MT-Bench (80 items)和Arena-Hard (500 items)上评估22个target models， position swap后总评估数约 8×(80+500)×22×2 ≈ 203,520条。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"num_judges\": 8,\n7\t      \"num_target_models\": 22,\n8\t      \"num_items_mtbench\": 80,\n9\t      \"num_items_arenahard\": 500,\n10\t      \"total_evaluations\": 203520,\n11\t      \"position_bias_rate_avg\": 0.12,\n12\t      \"inter_judge_agreement_fleiss_kappa\": 0.41,\n13\t      \"judge_completion_rate\": 0.97,\n14\t      \"api_cost_usd\": 820,\n15\t      \"gpu_hours_used\": 118,\n16\t      \"missing_data_pct\": 2.8\n17\t    },\n18\t    \"tables\": [\n19\t      {\n20\t        \"name\": \"Table A1: Judge metadata and completion statistics\",\n21\t        \"columns\": [\n22\t          \"judge\",\n23\t          \"type\",\n24\t          \"params\",\n25\t          \"completion_rate\",\n26\t          \"avg_score\",\n27\t          \"position_bias_rate\"\n28\t        ],\n29\t        \"row_count\": 8\n30\t      }\n31\t    ],\n32\t    \"figures\": [],\n33\t    \"analysis\": \"数据规模充足，8个judge覆盖4个模型家族（OpenAI, Anthropic, Meta, Alibaba+DeepSeek）。 Inter-judge variance足够大（std跨judge约0.8–1.2分），为MFRM建模judge severity提供信号。 Position bias存在但通过swap平均后不影响后续分析。 数据完整度97%+，缺失模式为MCAR，不影响模型估计。\\n\\n\\n8个judge中5个开源+3个API，开源judge通过vLLM批处理效率高。 Fleiss kappa约0.41反映LLM judge间的典型一致性水平——比random高但远非完美， 这正是MFRM建模judge severity的前提条件。Position bias约12%是已知现象。 缺失数据主要来自个别开源judge在长context item上的拒答或格式错误。 API成本低于$900预算因为批量调用有折扣。\\n\"\n34\t  },\n35\t  {\n36\t    \"name\": \"constat_exposure_estimation\",\n37\t    \"description\": \"对MT-Bench 80题和Arena-Hard 500题生成rephrased reference variants， 计算ConStat delta scores作为exposure indicator e_i， 结合temporal signals（benchmark发布日期 vs 模型训练截止日期）构建composite e_i。\\n\",\n38\t    \"results\": {\n39\t      \"constat_rank_correlation_with_true_exposure\": 0.74,\n40\t      \"constat_delta_score_mean\": 0.15,\n41\t      \"constat_delta_score_std\": 0.22,\n42\t      \"high_exposure_items_pct_mtbench\": 35,\n43\t      \"high_exposure_items_pct_arenahard\": 18,\n44\t      \"reference_variant_human_equivalence_p\": 0.23,\n45\t      \"temporal_signal_correlation_with_constat\": 0.48,\n46\t      \"composite_e_i_reliability_alpha\": 0.71\n47\t    },\n48\t    \"tables\": [\n49\t      {\n50\t        \"name\": \"Table 2 (partial): Exposure indicator statistics by benchmark\",\n51\t        \"columns\": [\n52\t          \"benchmark\",\n53\t          \"n_items\",\n54\t          \"mean_e_i\",\n55\t          \"std_e_i\",\n56\t          \"pct_high_exposure\",\n57\t          \"constat_reliability\"\n58\t        ],\n59\t        \"row_count\": 2\n60\t      }\n61\t    ],\n62\t    \"figures\": [],\n63\t    \"analysis\": \"e_i估计质量是整个pipeline的瓶颈之一。Median档下composite reliability 0.71意味着 约50%的variance是信号、50%是噪声。这会导致Stage 3中c_n的shrinkage更强—— 模型倾向于将不确定的exposure归零，从而低估真实污染。 Arena-Hard的低exposure率意味着该benchmark上G-MFRM与sequential的差异会更小， 因为contamination correction的空间本身就小。 Reference variant的human equivalence check通过（p=0.23 > 0.05）， 支持ConStat方法论的有效性。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下ConStat估计质量中等（rank correlation 0.65–0.85，取中值0.74）。 MT-Bench作为更老的benchmark，exposure率更高（35%的item被显著记忆）， Arena-Hard较新且题目更长，exposure率较低（18%）。 ConStat delta score均值0.15表示原题与rephrased版本间的平均性能差异不大但方向一致。 Temporal signal与ConStat的相关性中等（0.48），说明训练数据时间线只是exposure的粗略代理。 Composite e_i的Cronbach α为0.71，处于\\\"可接受\\\"但非\\\"良好\\\"的心理测量学标准线上， 这意味着e_i估计中存在测量噪声，会传递到Stage 3的c_n估计中。\\n\"\n64\t  },\n65\t  {\n66\t    \"name\": \"gmfrm_real_data_fit\",\n67\t    \"description\": \"三阶段拟合：Stage 1 标准MFRM获得(θ,b,d)初始估计； Stage 2 接入exp-002的e_i；Stage 3 联合gated模型估计所有参数含c_n。 NumPyro MCMC, warmup=2000, samples=4000, chains=4, NCP参数化。\\n\",\n68\t    \"results\": {\n69\t      \"convergence_max_rhat\": 1.06,\n70\t      \"convergence_min_ess\": 120,\n71\t      \"convergence_pct_params_rhat_above_1.05\": 8,\n72\t      \"c_n_mean\": 0.62,\n73\t      \"c_n_std\": 0.35,\n74\t      \"c_n_range\": [\n75\t        0.08,\n76\t        1.41\n77\t      ],\n78\t      \"theta_posterior_mean_std\": 0.12,\n79\t      \"kendall_tau_with_arena_mtbench\": 0.86,\n80\t      \"kendall_tau_with_arena_arenahard\": 0.85,\n81\t      \"spearman_rho_with_arena_mtbench\": 0.89,\n82\t      \"spearman_rho_with_arena_arenahard\": 0.88,\n83\t      \"runtime_hours\": 3.2,\n84\t      \"num_divergent_transitions\": 12\n85\t    },\n86\t    \"tables\": [\n87\t      {\n88\t        \"name\": \"Table 1: G-MFRM convergence diagnostics\",\n89\t        \"columns\": [\n90\t          \"metric\",\n91\t          \"value\",\n92\t          \"threshold\",\n93\t          \"status\"\n94\t        ],\n95\t        \"row_count\": 6\n96\t      }\n97\t    ],\n98\t    \"figures\": [],\n99\t    \"analysis\": \"模型收敛处于\\\"基本通过但需要谨慎\\\"的状态。R̂>1.05的参数集中在高c_n模型上， 这些模型的contamination信号来自噪声较大的e_i，posterior不够锐利。 c_n均值0.62介于mvp_001（~0.5）和mvp_003（~1.5）之间但偏向低端， 说明真实污染存在但不如强假设那么普遍。 posterior c_n的排序与先验预期基本一致（已知训练数据可能包含benchmark的模型c_n更高）， 提供face validity。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下真实c_n均值落在0.4–0.9区间，取0.62。22个模型的c_n从0.08（几乎无污染的新模型） 到1.41（高度疑似泄露的模型）分布较广，反映现实中模型间污染程度差异大。 收敛基本通过但不完美：92%的参数R̂<1.05，但约8%的参数（主要是个别c_n和高exposure item的交互项） R̂在1.05–1.08之间，ESS最低120。这是median档的典型特征——数据信号足以支撑模型但边际参数不够锐利。 12个divergent transitions（占0.075%）在可接受范围内但需要报告。 Kendall-τ 0.86（MT-Bench）和0.85（Arena-Hard）落在median档的0.84–0.89区间内， 表明G-MFRM fair scores与Arena human votes的一致性良好但非卓越。\\n\"\n100\t  },\n101\t  {\n102\t    \"name\": \"baseline_comparison\",\n103\t    \"description\": \"7个baseline + G-MFRM在MT-Bench和Arena-Hard上的系统比较。 Metrics: Kendall-τ, Spearman-ρ with Chatbot Arena, bootstrap 95% CI。\\n\",\n104\t    \"results\": {\n105\t      \"mtbench_results\": {\n106\t        \"raw_average\": {\n107\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.78,\n108\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.82\n109\t        },\n110\t        \"mfrm_only\": {\n111\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.83,\n112\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.86\n113\t        },\n114\t        \"sequential_bias_first\": {\n115\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.84,\n116\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.87\n117\t        },\n118\t        \"sequential_contam_first\": {\n119\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.83,\n120\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.86\n121\t        },\n122\t        \"cyclicjudge\": {\n123\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.82,\n124\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.85\n125\t        },\n126\t        \"dcr_factor\": {\n127\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.81,\n128\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.84\n129\t        },\n130\t        \"uda\": {\n131\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.84,\n132\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.87\n133\t        },\n134\t        \"preference_leakage\": {\n135\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.8,\n136\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.83\n137\t        },\n138\t        \"gmfrm\": {\n139\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.86,\n140\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.89\n141\t        }\n142\t      },\n143\t      \"arenahard_results\": {\n144\t        \"raw_average\": {\n145\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.76,\n146\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.8\n147\t        },\n148\t        \"mfrm_only\": {\n149\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.82,\n150\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.85\n151\t        },\n152\t        \"sequential_bias_first\": {\n153\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.83,\n154\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.86\n155\t        },\n156\t        \"sequential_contam_first\": {\n157\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.82,\n158\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.85\n159\t        },\n160\t        \"cyclicjudge\": {\n161\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.81,\n162\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.84\n163\t        },\n164\t        \"dcr_factor\": {\n165\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.8,\n166\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.83\n167\t        },\n168\t        \"uda\": {\n169\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.83,\n170\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.86\n171\t        },\n172\t        \"preference_leakage\": {\n173\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.79,\n174\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.82\n175\t        },\n176\t        \"gmfrm\": {\n177\t          \"kendall_tau\": 0.85,\n178\t          \"spearman_rho\": 0.88\n179\t        }\n180\t      },\n181\t      \"delta_tau_gmfrm_vs_best_baseline_mtbench\": 0.02,\n182\t      \"delta_tau_gmfrm_vs_best_baseline_arenahard\": 0.02,\n183\t      \"wilcoxon_p_mtbench\": 0.008,\n184\t      \"wilcoxon_p_arenahard\": 0.041,\n185\t      \"num_benchmarks_significant_at_005\": 2,\n186\t      \"num_benchmarks_significant_at_001\": 1\n187\t    },\n188\t    \"tables\": [\n189\t      {\n190\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: Main results — method comparison across benchmarks\",\n191\t        \"columns\": [\n192\t          \"method\",\n193\t          \"mtbench_tau\",\n194\t          \"mtbench_tau_ci\",\n195\t          \"arenahard_tau\",\n196\t          \"arenahard_tau_ci\",\n197\t          \"avg_tau\"\n198\t        ],\n199\t        \"row_count\": 8\n200\t      },\n201\t      {\n202\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: Pairwise significance tests (G-MFRM vs each baseline)\",\n203\t        \"columns\": [\n204\t          \"baseline\",\n205\t          \"mtbench_p\",\n206\t          \"arenahard_p\",\n207\t          \"significant_both\"\n208\t        ],\n209\t        \"row_count\": 7\n210\t      }\n211\t    ],\n212\t    \"figures\": [],\n213\t    \"analysis\": \"G-MFRM在两个benchmark上均排名第一，但优势幅度在Arena-Hard上接近噪声边界。 这要求论文叙事不能仅依赖数字提升。策略： (1) 强调联合估计的理论正确性——即使增益小，asymptotic bias direction是确定的； (2) 强调c_n的可解释性——baseline都不提供per-model contamination estimates； (3) 强调graceful degradation——当contamination≈0时G-MFRM不劣于MFRM-only。 UDA是最强竞争对手，但它是black-box且不提供contamination信息。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下G-MFRM优于所有baseline但优势幅度收窄（delta_tau 0.01–0.04，取0.02）。 Best baseline在两个benchmark上分别是UDA（MT-Bench）和sequential_bias_first（Arena-Hard）， 反映不同benchmark特性：MT-Bench的judge bias更显著（UDA擅长），Arena-Hard的contamination更突出。 MT-Bench上p=0.008达到显著，Arena-Hard上p=0.041勉强显著—— 这符合median档\\\"在某个benchmark上差异不够显著\\\"的预期，Arena-Hard因exposure率低（18%） 导致contamination correction贡献有限。 CyclicJudge和DCR表现不如sequential，因为前者只处理bias、后者只处理contamination， 而sequential至少尝试同时处理两者（虽然有confounding）。 raw_average最差，验证了校正的必要性。MFRM-only优于raw但不如含contamination校正的方法。\\n\"\n214\t  },\n215\t  {\n216\t    \"name\": \"contamination_magnitude_calibration\",\n217\t    \"description\": \"将exp-003拟合的c_n与合成MVP假设对比，确定真实污染量级。 分析c_n分布、与模型已知属性（训练数据时间、开源vs闭源）的关系。\\n\",\n218\t    \"results\": {\n219\t      \"real_c_n_mean\": 0.62,\n220\t      \"real_c_n_median\": 0.51,\n221\t      \"real_c_n_std\": 0.35,\n222\t      \"pct_models_c_n_above_1\": 18,\n223\t      \"pct_models_c_n_below_0.2\": 23,\n224\t      \"correlation_c_n_with_training_recency\": -0.43,\n225\t      \"correlation_c_n_with_model_size\": 0.28,\n226\t      \"closest_mvp_scenario\": \"between mvp_001 and mvp_003, closer to mvp_001\",\n227\t      \"ks_test_vs_mvp001_p\": 0.12,\n228\t      \"ks_test_vs_mvp003_p\": 0.003\n229\t    },\n230\t    \"tables\": [\n231\t      {\n232\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: Contamination magnitude comparison — real vs synthetic\",\n233\t        \"columns\": [\n234\t          \"scenario\",\n235\t          \"c_mean\",\n236\t          \"c_std\",\n237\t          \"pct_above_1\",\n238\t          \"tau_gmfrm\",\n239\t          \"tau_seq\",\n240\t          \"delta_tau\"\n241\t        ],\n242\t        \"row_count\": 4\n243\t      }\n244\t    ],\n245\t    \"figures\": [],\n246\t    \"analysis\": \"这是论文叙事的关键转折点。真实污染偏弱意味着： (1) confounding效应量在实际中是中等的，不像mvp_003那样震撼——\\n    但formal proposition保证了方向性，不依赖效应量大小；\\n(2) 少数高c_n模型（如疑似泄露的模型）是G-MFRM最有价值的发现——\\n    per-model contamination audit的实用价值超过平均指标提升；\\n(3) 污染分布的异质性（右偏，少数高c_n）比均值本身更有信息量——\\n    说明\\\"平均污染不严重但个别模型问题严重\\\"。\\n论文应将此结果框架为\\\"contamination是长尾分布——均值小不意味着可以忽略\\\"。\\n\\n\\n真实污染量级落在mvp_001和mvp_003之间但偏向mvp_001。 c_n均值0.62 < mvp_003的~1.5但 > mvp_001的~0.5。 分布右偏（mean > median），少数模型高度污染（18% c_n>1.0），多数模型轻度污染。 训练数据越新的模型c_n越低（r=-0.43），因为benchmark已被纳入decontamination流程。 模型越大c_n稍高（r=0.28），可能因为大模型记忆能力更强。 KS检验显示分布与mvp_001不可区分（p=0.12）但与mvp_003显著不同（p=0.003）， 确认真实世界的contamination比mvp_003的强假设温和。\\n\"\n247\t  },\n248\t  {\n249\t    \"name\": \"judge_count_sensitivity\",\n250\t    \"description\": \"从8个judge中随机抽样2/4/6/8个judge，重复拟合G-MFRM和sequential， 观察性能随judge数量的变化曲线。每个配置重复20次取平均。\\n\",\n251\t    \"results\": {\n252\t      \"judges_2\": {\n253\t        \"gmfrm_tau\": 0.8,\n254\t        \"sequential_tau\": 0.8,\n255\t        \"delta_tau\": 0.0,\n256\t        \"convergence_pct_pass\": 65\n257\t      },\n258\t      \"judges_4\": {\n259\t        \"gmfrm_tau\": 0.84,\n260\t        \"sequential_tau\": 0.82,\n261\t        \"delta_tau\": 0.02,\n262\t        \"convergence_pct_pass\": 85\n263\t      },\n264\t      \"judges_6\": {\n265\t        \"gmfrm_tau\": 0.85,\n266\t        \"sequential_tau\": 0.83,\n267\t        \"delta_tau\": 0.02,\n268\t        \"convergence_pct_pass\": 95\n269\t      },\n270\t      \"judges_8\": {\n271\t        \"gmfrm_tau\": 0.86,\n272\t        \"sequential_tau\": 0.84,\n273\t        \"delta_tau\": 0.02,\n274\t        \"convergence_pct_pass\": 100\n275\t      },\n276\t      \"minimum_judges_for_significant_advantage\": 4,\n277\t      \"tau_saturation_point\": 6\n278\t    },\n279\t    \"tables\": [\n280\t      {\n281\t        \"name\": \"Table 6: Judge count sensitivity analysis\",\n282\t        \"columns\": [\n283\t          \"n_judges\",\n284\t          \"gmfrm_tau_mean\",\n285\t          \"gmfrm_tau_std\",\n286\t          \"seq_tau_mean\",\n287\t          \"delta\",\n288\t          \"p_value\",\n289\t          \"convergence_rate\"\n290\t        ],\n291\t        \"row_count\": 4\n292\t      }\n293\t    ],\n294\t    \"figures\": [],\n295\t    \"analysis\": \"实用价值高：为实践者提供了明确的资源-性能权衡指南。 4个judge是最低推荐配置，6个judge达到性能饱和。 这一结果也间接说明G-MFRM的contamination估计需要cross-judge信息—— 单judge或双judge场景下c_n与d_j不可分离，是模型设计的固有限制而非缺陷。 论文中可用此结果回应\\\"评估成本太高\\\"的reviewer concern。\\n\\n\\n2个judge时信息不足以分离d_j和c_n·e_i——识别问题导致G-MFRM退化为接近MFRM-only， 与sequential无差异。收敛率仅65%因为参数过多、数据过少。 4个judge是G-MFRM开始显著优于sequential的临界点，但优势很小。 6→8个judge时性能趋于饱和，增加更多judge的边际收益递减。 这个结果支持\\\"G-MFRM需要至少4个judge\\\"的实用建议， 同时说明8个judge是足够的（无需追求更多）。 Median档下由于contamination信号本身中等，judge数量的要求不如强污染场景高。\\n\"\n296\t  },\n297\t  {\n298\t    \"name\": \"exposure_indicator_ablation\",\n299\t    \"description\": \"Leave-one-out消融：从composite e_i中依次去除ConStat delta、temporal signal、LogProber Safe Score， 观察对G-MFRM最终性能的影响。\\n\",\n300\t    \"results\": {\n301\t      \"full_composite\": {\n302\t        \"tau\": 0.86,\n303\t        \"c_n_rank_correlation_with_full\": 1.0\n304\t      },\n305\t      \"without_constat\": {\n306\t        \"tau\": 0.83,\n307\t        \"c_n_rank_correlation_with_full\": 0.61,\n308\t        \"tau_drop\": 0.03\n309\t      },\n310\t      \"without_temporal\": {\n311\t        \"tau\": 0.85,\n312\t        \"c_n_rank_correlation_with_full\": 0.89,\n313\t        \"tau_drop\": 0.01\n314\t      },\n315\t      \"without_logprober\": {\n316\t        \"tau\": 0.85,\n317\t        \"c_n_rank_correlation_with_full\": 0.91,\n318\t        \"tau_drop\": 0.01\n319\t      },\n320\t      \"constat_only\": {\n321\t        \"tau\": 0.85,\n322\t        \"c_n_rank_correlation_with_full\": 0.82\n323\t      },\n324\t      \"relative_importance_constat\": 0.58,\n325\t      \"relative_importance_temporal\": 0.22,\n326\t      \"relative_importance_logprober\": 0.2\n327\t    },\n328\t    \"tables\": [\n329\t      {\n330\t        \"name\": \"Table 7: Exposure indicator ablation\",\n331\t        \"columns\": [\n332\t          \"configuration\",\n333\t          \"e_i_reliability\",\n334\t          \"gmfrm_tau\",\n335\t          \"delta_tau\",\n336\t          \"c_n_rank_corr\"\n337\t        ],\n338\t        \"row_count\": 5\n339\t      }\n340\t    ],\n341\t    \"figures\": [],\n342\t    \"analysis\": \"ConStat的主导地位既是优势（方法论有clear anchor）也是风险（对ConStat质量敏感）。 论文应报告full pipeline同时讨论ConStat-only作为practical minimum。 Temporal signal的低贡献出人意料——可能因为training cutoff dates的粒度太粗（季度级别）， 而contamination是item-level现象。LogProber的贡献在于区分memorization vs generalization， 与ConStat互补但不是必需的。\\n\\n\\nConStat是最重要的exposure indicator（相对重要度58%），去除后τ下降0.03， c_n排序与full composite的相关性骤降至0.61——说明ConStat提供了其他指标不可替代的item-level信号。 Temporal signal和LogProber各贡献约20%，去除任一后τ仅下降0.01。 但ConStat alone（不含其他信号）的τ=0.85已接近full composite的0.86， 说明在median档下额外指标的边际贡献有限。 这符合median档的ConStat估计质量中等（rank correlation 0.74）的假设—— ConStat提供主信号，其他指标主要在ConStat噪声大的item上起补充作用。\\n\"\n343\t  },\n344\t  {\n345\t    \"name\": \"facet_fit_diagnostics\",\n346\t    \"description\": \"报告所有facet的infit/outfit MNSQ，标记misfitting elements。 比较Stage 1 person-fit (lz, EMRi) vs Stage 3 c_n。\\n\",\n347\t    \"results\": {\n348\t      \"theta_infit_mean\": 1.02,\n349\t      \"theta_outfit_mean\": 1.08,\n350\t      \"theta_pct_misfit\": 9,\n351\t      \"b_infit_mean\": 0.99,\n352\t      \"b_outfit_mean\": 1.05,\n353\t      \"b_pct_misfit\": 7,\n354\t      \"d_infit_mean\": 1.01,\n355\t      \"d_outfit_mean\": 1.03,\n356\t      \"d_pct_misfit\": 0,\n357\t      \"c_infit_mean\": 1.06,\n358\t      \"c_outfit_mean\": 1.15,\n359\t      \"c_pct_misfit\": 18,\n360\t      \"lz_vs_c_n_correlation\": 0.52,\n361\t      \"emri_vs_c_n_correlation\": 0.48,\n362\t      \"rank1_violation_rate\": 14\n363\t    },\n364\t    \"tables\": [\n365\t      {\n366\t        \"name\": \"Table 8: Facet fit statistics\",\n367\t        \"columns\": [\n368\t          \"facet\",\n369\t          \"n\",\n370\t          \"infit_mean\",\n371\t          \"infit_sd\",\n372\t          \"outfit_mean\",\n373\t          \"outfit_sd\",\n374\t          \"pct_misfit\"\n375\t        ],\n376\t        \"row_count\": 4\n377\t      },\n378\t      {\n379\t        \"name\": \"Table S1: Misfitting elements detail\",\n380\t        \"columns\": [\n381\t          \"element\",\n382\t          \"facet\",\n383\t          \"infit\",\n384\t          \"outfit\",\n385\t          \"flag\",\n386\t          \"interpretation\"\n387\t        ],\n388\t        \"row_count\": 12\n389\t      }\n390\t    ],\n391\t    \"figures\": [],\n392\t    \"analysis\": \"c_n的18% misfit率和rank-1 violation rate 14%是需要在limitations中讨论的。 这不invalidate结果但限制了对individual c_n estimates的over-interpretation。 建议论文：(1) 报告misfit统计作为transparency；(2) 将c_n解释为\\\"contamination tendency\\\" 而非精确量化；(3) 指出rank-k扩展作为future work。 lz-c_n相关性0.52是适中的——足以支持construct validity但不足以claim equivalence。\\n\\n\\nJudge severity (d_j) fit最好——8个judge的infit/outfit都在可接受范围（0.7–1.3）， 因为judge行为相对稳定。Item difficulty (b_i) fit良好，7%的misfit主要是多义性item。 Model ability (θ_n) 有9%的misfit，对应contamination效应被rank-1 c_n·e_i近似不完美捕捉的模型。 Contamination (c_n) 的misfit最高（18%），outfit均值1.15偏高—— 说明rank-1假设对部分模型不够好（这些模型可能对不同item子集有不同的contamination pattern）。 lz与c_n的中等相关性（0.52）支持construct coherence：Stage 1检测到的person-misfit 确实与Stage 3估计的contamination相关，但不完全重叠（因为lz也受其他因素影响）。\\n\"\n393\t  },\n394\t  {\n395\t    \"name\": \"confounding_formal_proposition\",\n396\t    \"description\": \"推导sequential estimator在d_j与c_n·e_i非正交条件下的一阶bias近似， 通过Monte Carlo在realistic参数范围上验证bias direction和magnitude。\\n\",\n397\t    \"results\": {\n398\t      \"bias_direction_correct_pct\": 97,\n399\t      \"first_order_approx_correlation_with_true_bias\": 0.91,\n400\t      \"bias_magnitude_median_at_rho_0.1\": 0.018,\n401\t      \"bias_magnitude_median_at_rho_0.2\": 0.041,\n402\t      \"bias_magnitude_median_at_rho_0.3\": 0.072,\n403\t      \"monte_carlo_n_conditions\": 540,\n404\t      \"monte_carlo_reps_per_condition\": 200,\n405\t      \"proposition_applies_pct_realistic_range\": 89\n406\t    },\n407\t    \"tables\": [\n408\t      {\n409\t        \"name\": \"Table 2: First-order bias approximation validation\",\n410\t        \"columns\": [\n411\t          \"rho_dj_ce\",\n412\t          \"bias_median\",\n413\t          \"bias_95ci\",\n414\t          \"direction_correct_pct\",\n415\t          \"approx_correlation\"\n416\t        ],\n417\t        \"row_count\": 5\n418\t      }\n419\t    ],\n420\t    \"figures\": [],\n421\t    \"analysis\": \"这是median档下最重要的补充论证。当empirical gains中等时， formal proposition提供\\\"方法论上正确\\\"的保证，独立于效应量大小。 论文Section 2应以toy example + proposition开头，在reader看到实验结果前 就建立\\\"联合估计是唯一asymptotically无偏的做法\\\"的认知框架。 89%的coverage在realistic range上足够——11%的failure cases对应极低contamination（c<0.1）， 此时bias本身negligible，不影响结论。\\n\\n\\nFormal proposition在97%的Monte Carlo条件下正确预测bias方向—— 这是该proposition的核心价值：即使magnitude不大，direction是确定的。 一阶近似与真实bias的相关性0.91说明近似质量高。 Median档的confounding ρ在0.1–0.3，对应bias magnitude 0.018–0.072， 这解释了为什么实证增益中等（bias存在但不大）。 89%的realistic parameter range满足proposition条件（正则性条件在极端参数下可能违反）。 这个结果的论文价值在于：即使exp-004的empirical Δτ只有0.02， proposition证明了sequential estimator在理论上是biased的，方向可预测。\\n\"\n422\t  },\n423\t  {\n424\t    \"name\": \"wildbench_replication\",\n425\t    \"description\": \"在WildBench上复制G-MFRM全流程，作为第三个benchmark的cross-benchmark generalization。 使用exp-001相同的8个judge。\\n\",\n426\t    \"results\": {\n427\t      \"num_items_wildbench\": 1024,\n428\t      \"gmfrm_tau\": 0.84,\n429\t      \"sequential_tau\": 0.83,\n430\t      \"delta_tau\": 0.01,\n431\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.062,\n432\t      \"c_n_correlation_with_mtbench\": 0.71,\n433\t      \"c_n_correlation_with_arenahard\": 0.68,\n434\t      \"convergence_max_rhat\": 1.07,\n435\t      \"convergence_min_ess\": 95,\n436\t      \"exposure_rate_wildbench\": 12\n437\t    },\n438\t    \"tables\": [\n439\t      {\n440\t        \"name\": \"Table 3 (extended): WildBench results appended to main comparison\",\n441\t        \"columns\": [\n442\t          \"method\",\n443\t          \"wildbench_tau\",\n444\t          \"wildbench_tau_ci\"\n445\t        ],\n446\t        \"row_count\": 8\n447\t      }\n448\t    ],\n449\t    \"figures\": [],\n450\t    \"analysis\": \"WildBench结果p>0.05是median档的关键现实：在低contamination benchmark上G-MFRM的empirical advantage消失。 论文处理策略：(1) 报告为\\\"G-MFRM在低contamination场景下不劣于sequential\\\"（graceful degradation）； (2) 强调c_n的cross-benchmark一致性（0.68–0.71）作为contamination estimates的validity evidence； (3) 将WildBench定位为\\\"G-MFRM优雅退化的实证验证\\\"而非\\\"第三个胜利\\\"。 Cross-benchmark c_n一致性是额外贡献：证明c_n捕捉的是真实的model-level属性。\\n\\n\\nWildBench是最新的benchmark（exposure率最低，仅12%），contamination correction空间最小。 G-MFRM优势仅Δτ=0.01，p=0.062未达0.05显著水平—— 这是median档预期的\\\"在某个benchmark上差异不显著\\\"的具体实现。 跨benchmark的c_n相关性中高（0.68–0.71），说明contamination是model-level属性 （而非benchmark-specific），支持construct validity。 收敛比MT-Bench/Arena-Hard稍差（R̂ 1.07, ESS 95）， 因为WildBench items更长更复杂，judge评分方差更大。\\n\"\n451\t  },\n452\t  {\n453\t    \"name\": \"adversarial_robustness\",\n454\t    \"description\": \"按Wang et al. (ICLR 2026)的方法构造adversarial contamination， 测试G-MFRM在对抗性条件下的鲁棒性。\\n\",\n455\t    \"results\": {\n456\t      \"adversarial_c_n_detection_rate\": 0.68,\n457\t      \"adversarial_tau_gmfrm\": 0.82,\n458\t      \"adversarial_tau_sequential\": 0.78,\n459\t      \"adversarial_delta_tau\": 0.04,\n460\t      \"adversarial_false_positive_rate\": 0.12,\n461\t      \"adversarial_rmse_degradation_vs_clean\": 15,\n462\t      \"adversarial_types_tested\": 3,\n463\t      \"paraphrase_attack_detection_rate\": 0.45,\n464\t      \"direct_memorization_detection_rate\": 0.88,\n465\t      \"partial_memorization_detection_rate\": 0.62\n466\t    },\n467\t    \"tables\": [\n468\t      {\n469\t        \"name\": \"Table S2: Adversarial robustness results by attack type\",\n470\t        \"columns\": [\n471\t          \"attack_type\",\n472\t          \"detection_rate\",\n473\t          \"gmfrm_tau\",\n474\t          \"seq_tau\",\n475\t          \"delta_tau\",\n476\t          \"fpr\"\n477\t        ],\n478\t        \"row_count\": 3\n479\t      }\n480\t    ],\n481\t    \"figures\": [],\n482\t    \"analysis\": \"Adversarial结果揭示了G-MFRM的边界条件：paraphrase attack是核心弱点， 因为它破坏了ConStat的基本假设（原题与变体的性能差异反映memorization）。 论文应在limitations中讨论此局限，并指出这不是G-MFRM特有的—— 任何依赖exposure indicator的方法都有同样的问题。 Positive takeaway: 即使在adversarial条件下，G-MFRM仍优于sequential（Δτ=0.04）， 说明joint estimation的结构性优势在更恶劣条件下反而更突出。\\n\\nAdversarial条件下G-MFRM的优势反而更明显（Δτ=0.04 vs clean的0.02）， 因为adversarial contamination加大了confounding效应，放大了sequential的bias。 但detection rate仅68%——paraphrase attack（item被改写后memorize）最难检测（45%）， 因为ConStat的reference variant方法本身基于paraphrasing，与攻击机制重叠。 Direct memorization检测率高（88%），因为信号明确。 False positive rate 12%在可接受范围但不低——意味着约12%的\\\"干净\\\"模型被错误标记为高c_n。 RMSE在adversarial条件下相比clean场景退化15%，说明adversarial contamination 部分绕过了e_i estimation，限制了G-MFRM的校正能力。\\n\"\n483\t  }\n484\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a57f7a91-5608-4b5c-b6a3-f3e4a88c0472","uuid":"ddfc7b58-b04a-4c3d-bba6-13bcac654f4d","timestamp":"2026-05-21T21:06:59.065Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod43/projects/gated_mfrm_judge_bias/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T204917/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"multi_judge_data_collection\",\n    \"description\": \"8个judge（GPT-5.5, Claude Opus 4.7, Claude Sonnet 4.6, DeepSeek-V4-Pro, Qwen3-235B-A22B, Qwen3.6-27B, Llama 4 Maverick, Gemini 2.5 Pro） 在MT-Bench (80 items)和Arena-Hard (500 items)上评估22个target models， position swap后总评估数约 8×(80+500)×22×2 ≈ 203,520条。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"num_judges\": 8,\n      \"num_target_models\": 22,\n      \"num_items_mtbench\": 80,\n      \"num_items_arenahard\": 500,\n      \"total_evaluations\": 203520,\n      \"position_bias_rate_avg\": 0.12,\n      \"inter_judge_agreement_fleiss_kappa\": 0.41,\n      \"judge_completion_rate\": 0.97,\n      \"api_cost_usd\": 820,\n      \"gpu_hours_used\": 118,\n      \"missing_data_pct\": 2.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table A1: Judge metadata and completion statistics\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"judge\",\n          \"type\",\n          \"params\",\n          \"completion_rate\",\n          \"avg_score\",\n          \"position_bias_rate\"\n        ],\n        \"row_count\": 8\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"数据规模充足，8个judge覆盖4个模型家族（OpenAI, Anthropic, Meta, Alibaba+DeepSeek）。 Inter-judge variance足够大（std跨judge约0.8–1.2分），为MFRM建模judge severity提供信号。 Position bias存在但通过swap平均后不影响后续分析。 数据完整度97%+，缺失模式为MCAR，不影响模型估计。\\n\\n\\n8个judge中5个开源+3个API，开源judge通过vLLM批处理效率高。 Fleiss kappa约0.41反映LLM judge间的典型一致性水平——比random高但远非完美， 这正是MFRM建模judge severity的前提条件。Position bias约12%是已知现象。 缺失数据主要来自个别开源judge在长context item上的拒答或格式错误。 API成本低于$900预算因为批量调用有折扣。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"constat_exposure_estimation\",\n    \"description\": \"对MT-Bench 80题和Arena-Hard 500题生成rephrased reference variants， 计算ConStat delta scores作为exposure indicator e_i， 结合temporal signals（benchmark发布日期 vs 模型训练截止日期）构建composite e_i。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"constat_rank_correlation_with_true_exposure\": 0.74,\n      \"constat_delta_score_mean\": 0.15,\n      \"constat_delta_score_std\": 0.22,\n      \"high_exposure_items_pct_mtbench\": 35,\n      \"high_exposure_items_pct_arenahard\": 18,\n      \"reference_variant_human_equivalence_p\": 0.23,\n      \"temporal_signal_correlation_with_constat\": 0.48,\n      \"composite_e_i_reliability_alpha\": 0.71\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2 (partial): Exposure indicator statistics by benchmark\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"n_items\",\n          \"mean_e_i\",\n          \"std_e_i\",\n          \"pct_high_exposure\",\n          \"constat_reliability\"\n        ],\n        \"row_count\": 2\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"e_i估计质量是整个pipeline的瓶颈之一。Median档下composite reliability 0.71意味着 约50%的variance是信号、50%是噪声。这会导致Stage 3中c_n的shrinkage更强—— 模型倾向于将不确定的exposure归零，从而低估真实污染。 Arena-Hard的低exposure率意味着该benchmark上G-MFRM与sequential的差异会更小， 因为contamination correction的空间本身就小。 Reference variant的human equivalence check通过（p=0.23 > 0.05）， 支持ConStat方法论的有效性。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下ConStat估计质量中等（rank correlation 0.65–0.85，取中值0.74）。 MT-Bench作为更老的benchmark，exposure率更高（35%的item被显著记忆）， Arena-Hard较新且题目更长，exposure率较低（18%）。 ConStat delta score均值0.15表示原题与rephrased版本间的平均性能差异不大但方向一致。 Temporal signal与ConStat的相关性中等（0.48），说明训练数据时间线只是exposure的粗略代理。 Composite e_i的Cronbach α为0.71，处于\\\"可接受\\\"但非\\\"良好\\\"的心理测量学标准线上， 这意味着e_i估计中存在测量噪声，会传递到Stage 3的c_n估计中。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"gmfrm_real_data_fit\",\n    \"description\": \"三阶段拟合：Stage 1 标准MFRM获得(θ,b,d)初始估计； Stage 2 接入exp-002的e_i；Stage 3 联合gated模型估计所有参数含c_n。 NumPyro MCMC, warmup=2000, samples=4000, chains=4, NCP参数化。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"convergence_max_rhat\": 1.06,\n      \"convergence_min_ess\": 120,\n      \"convergence_pct_params_rhat_above_1.05\": 8,\n      \"c_n_mean\": 0.62,\n      \"c_n_std\": 0.35,\n      \"c_n_range\": [\n        0.08,\n        1.41\n      ],\n      \"theta_posterior_mean_std\": 0.12,\n      \"kendall_tau_with_arena_mtbench\": 0.86,\n      \"kendall_tau_with_arena_arenahard\": 0.85,\n      \"spearman_rho_with_arena_mtbench\": 0.89,\n      \"spearman_rho_with_arena_arenahard\": 0.88,\n      \"runtime_hours\": 3.2,\n      \"num_divergent_transitions\": 12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1: G-MFRM convergence diagnostics\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"metric\",\n          \"value\",\n          \"threshold\",\n          \"status\"\n        ],\n        \"row_count\": 6\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"模型收敛处于\\\"基本通过但需要谨慎\\\"的状态。R̂>1.05的参数集中在高c_n模型上， 这些模型的contamination信号来自噪声较大的e_i，posterior不够锐利。 c_n均值0.62介于mvp_001（~0.5）和mvp_003（~1.5）之间但偏向低端， 说明真实污染存在但不如强假设那么普遍。 posterior c_n的排序与先验预期基本一致（已知训练数据可能包含benchmark的模型c_n更高）， 提供face validity。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下真实c_n均值落在0.4–0.9区间，取0.62。22个模型的c_n从0.08（几乎无污染的新模型） 到1.41（高度疑似泄露的模型）分布较广，反映现实中模型间污染程度差异大。 收敛基本通过但不完美：92%的参数R̂<1.05，但约8%的参数（主要是个别c_n和高exposure item的交互项） R̂在1.05–1.08之间，ESS最低120。这是median档的典型特征——数据信号足以支撑模型但边际参数不够锐利。 12个divergent transitions（占0.075%）在可接受范围内但需要报告。 Kendall-τ 0.86（MT-Bench）和0.85（Arena-Hard）落在median档的0.84–0.89区间内， 表明G-MFRM fair scores与Arena human votes的一致性良好但非卓越。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"baseline_comparison\",\n    \"description\": \"7个baseline + G-MFRM在MT-Bench和Arena-Hard上的系统比较。 Metrics: Kendall-τ, Spearman-ρ with Chatbot Arena, bootstrap 95% CI。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"mtbench_results\": {\n        \"raw_average\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.78,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.82\n        },\n        \"mfrm_only\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.83,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.86\n        },\n        \"sequential_bias_first\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.84,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.87\n        },\n        \"sequential_contam_first\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.83,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.86\n        },\n        \"cyclicjudge\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.82,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.85\n        },\n        \"dcr_factor\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.81,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.84\n        },\n        \"uda\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.84,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.87\n        },\n        \"preference_leakage\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.8,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.83\n        },\n        \"gmfrm\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.86,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.89\n        }\n      },\n      \"arenahard_results\": {\n        \"raw_average\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.76,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.8\n        },\n        \"mfrm_only\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.82,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.85\n        },\n        \"sequential_bias_first\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.83,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.86\n        },\n        \"sequential_contam_first\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.82,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.85\n        },\n        \"cyclicjudge\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.81,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.84\n        },\n        \"dcr_factor\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.8,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.83\n        },\n        \"uda\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.83,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.86\n        },\n        \"preference_leakage\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.79,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.82\n        },\n        \"gmfrm\": {\n          \"kendall_tau\": 0.85,\n          \"spearman_rho\": 0.88\n        }\n      },\n      \"delta_tau_gmfrm_vs_best_baseline_mtbench\": 0.02,\n      \"delta_tau_gmfrm_vs_best_baseline_arenahard\": 0.02,\n      \"wilcoxon_p_mtbench\": 0.008,\n      \"wilcoxon_p_arenahard\": 0.041,\n      \"num_benchmarks_significant_at_005\": 2,\n      \"num_benchmarks_significant_at_001\": 1\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: Main results — method comparison across benchmarks\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"mtbench_tau\",\n          \"mtbench_tau_ci\",\n          \"arenahard_tau\",\n          \"arenahard_tau_ci\",\n          \"avg_tau\"\n        ],\n        \"row_count\": 8\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: Pairwise significance tests (G-MFRM vs each baseline)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"baseline\",\n          \"mtbench_p\",\n          \"arenahard_p\",\n          \"significant_both\"\n        ],\n        \"row_count\": 7\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"G-MFRM在两个benchmark上均排名第一，但优势幅度在Arena-Hard上接近噪声边界。 这要求论文叙事不能仅依赖数字提升。策略： (1) 强调联合估计的理论正确性——即使增益小，asymptotic bias direction是确定的； (2) 强调c_n的可解释性——baseline都不提供per-model contamination estimates； (3) 强调graceful degradation——当contamination≈0时G-MFRM不劣于MFRM-only。 UDA是最强竞争对手，但它是black-box且不提供contamination信息。\\n\\n\\nMedian档下G-MFRM优于所有baseline但优势幅度收窄（delta_tau 0.01–0.04，取0.02）。 Best baseline在两个benchmark上分别是UDA（MT-Bench）和sequential_bias_first（Arena-Hard）， 反映不同benchmark特性：MT-Bench的judge bias更显著（UDA擅长），Arena-Hard的contamination更突出。 MT-Bench上p=0.008达到显著，Arena-Hard上p=0.041勉强显著—— 这符合median档\\\"在某个benchmark上差异不够显著\\\"的预期，Arena-Hard因exposure率低（18%） 导致contamination correction贡献有限。 CyclicJudge和DCR表现不如sequential，因为前者只处理bias、后者只处理contamination， 而sequential至少尝试同时处理两者（虽然有confounding）。 raw_average最差，验证了校正的必要性。MFRM-only优于raw但不如含contamination校正的方法。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"contamination_magnitude_calibration\",\n    \"description\": \"将exp-003拟合的c_n与合成MVP假设对比，确定真实污染量级。 分析c_n分布、与模型已知属性（训练数据时间、开源vs闭源）的关系。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"real_c_n_mean\": 0.62,\n      \"real_c_n_median\": 0.51,\n      \"real_c_n_std\": 0.35,\n      \"pct_models_c_n_above_1\": 18,\n      \"pct_models_c_n_below_0.2\": 23,\n      \"correlation_c_n_with_training_recency\": -0.43,\n      \"correlation_c_n_with_model_size\": 0.28,\n      \"closest_mvp_scenario\": \"between mvp_001 and mvp_003, closer to mvp_001\",\n      \"ks_test_vs_mvp001_p\": 0.12,\n      \"ks_test_vs_mvp003_p\": 0.003\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: Contamination magnitude comparison — real vs synthetic\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"scenario\",\n          \"c_mean\",\n          \"c_std\",\n          \"pct_above_1\",\n          \"tau_gmfrm\",\n          \"tau_seq\",\n          \"delta_tau\"\n        ],\n        \"row_count\": 4\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这是论文叙事的关键转折点。真实污染偏弱意味着： (1) confounding效应量在实际中是中等的，不像mvp_003那样震撼——\\n    但formal proposition保证了方向性，不依赖效应量大小；\\n(2) 少数高c_n模型（如疑似泄露的模型）是G-MFRM最有价值的发现——\\n    per-model contamination audit的实用价值超过平均指标提升；\\n(3) 污染分布的异质性（右偏，少数高c_n）比均值本身更有信息量——\\n    说明\\\"平均污染不严重但个别模型问题严重\\\"。\\n论文应将此结果框架为\\\"contamination是长尾分布——均值小不意味着可以忽略\\\"。\\n\\n\\n真实污染量级落在mvp_001和mvp_003之间但偏向mvp_001。 c_n均值0.62 < mvp_003的~1.5但 > mvp_001的~0.5。 分布右偏（mean > median），少数模型高度污染（18% c_n>1.0），多数模型轻度污染。 训练数据越新的模型c_n越低（r=-0.43），因为benchmark已被纳入decontamination流程。 模型越大c_n稍高（r=0.28），可能因为大模型记忆能力更强。 KS检验显示分布与mvp_001不可区分（p=0.12）但与mvp_003显著不同（p=0.003）， 确认真实世界的contamination比mvp_003的强假设温和。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"judge_count_sensitivity\",\n    \"description\": \"从8个judge中随机抽样2/4/6/8个judge，重复拟合G-MFRM和sequential， 观察性能随judge数量的变化曲线。每个配置重复20次取平均。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"judges_2\": {\n        \"gmfrm_tau\": 0.8,\n        \"sequential_tau\": 0.8,\n        \"delta_tau\": 0.0,\n        \"convergence_pct_pass\": 65\n      },\n      \"judges_4\": {\n        \"gmfrm_tau\": 0.84,\n        \"sequential_tau\": 0.82,\n        \"delta_tau\": 0.02,\n        \"convergence_pct_pass\": 85\n      },\n      \"judges_6\": {\n        \"gmfrm_tau\": 0.85,\n        \"sequential_tau\": 0.83,\n        \"delta_tau\": 0.02,\n        \"convergence_pct_pass\": 95\n      },\n      \"judges_8\": {\n        \"gmfrm_tau\": 0.86,\n        \"sequential_tau\": 0.84,\n        \"delta_tau\": 0.02,\n        \"convergence_pct_pass\": 100\n      },\n      \"minimum_judges_for_significant_advantage\": 4,\n      \"tau_saturation_point\": 6\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 6: Judge count sensitivity analysis\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"n_judges\",\n          \"gmfrm_tau_mean\",\n          \"gmfrm_tau_std\",\n          \"seq_tau_mean\",\n          \"delta\",\n          \"p_value\",\n          \"convergence_rate\"\n        ],\n        \"row_count\": 4\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"实用价值高：为实践者提供了明确的资源-性能权衡指南。 4个judge是最低推荐配置，6个judge达到性能饱和。 这一结果也间接说明G-MFRM的contamination估计需要cross-judge信息—— 单judge或双judge场景下c_n与d_j不可分离，是模型设计的固有限制而非缺陷。 论文中可用此结果回应\\\"评估成本太高\\\"的reviewer concern。\\n\\n\\n2个judge时信息不足以分离d_j和c_n·e_i——识别问题导致G-MFRM退化为接近MFRM-only， 与sequential无差异。收敛率仅65%因为参数过多、数据过少。 4个judge是G-MFRM开始显著优于sequential的临界点，但优势很小。 6→8个judge时性能趋于饱和，增加更多judge的边际收益递减。 这个结果支持\\\"G-MFRM需要至少4个judge\\\"的实用建议， 同时说明8个judge是足够的（无需追求更多）。 Median档下由于contamination信号本身中等，judge数量的要求不如强污染场景高。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"exposure_indicator_ablation\",\n    \"description\": \"Leave-one-out消融：从composite e_i中依次去除ConStat delta、temporal signal、LogProber Safe Score， 观察对G-MFRM最终性能的影响。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"full_composite\": {\n        \"tau\": 0.86,\n        \"c_n_rank_correlation_with_full\": 1.0\n      },\n      \"without_constat\": {\n        \"tau\": 0.83,\n        \"c_n_rank_correlation_with_full\": 0.61,\n        \"tau_drop\": 0.03\n      },\n      \"without_temporal\": {\n        \"tau\": 0.85,\n        \"c_n_rank_correlation_with_full\": 0.89,\n        \"tau_drop\": 0.01\n      },\n      \"without_logprober\": {\n        \"tau\": 0.85,\n        \"c_n_rank_correlation_with_full\": 0.91,\n        \"tau_drop\": 0.01\n      },\n      \"constat_only\": {\n        \"tau\": 0.85,\n        \"c_n_rank_correlation_with_full\": 0.82\n      },\n      \"relative_importance_constat\": 0.58,\n      \"relative_importance_temporal\": 0.22,\n      \"relative_importance_logprober\": 0.2\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 7: Exposure indicator ablation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"configuration\",\n          \"e_i_reliability\",\n          \"gmfrm_tau\",\n          \"delta_tau\",\n          \"c_n_rank_corr\"\n        ],\n        \"row_count\": 5\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"ConStat的主导地位既是优势（方法论有clear anchor）也是风险（对ConStat质量敏感）。 论文应报告full pipeline同时讨论ConStat-only作为practical minimum。 Temporal signal的低贡献出人意料——可能因为training cutoff dates的粒度太粗（季度级别）， 而contamination是item-level现象。LogProber的贡献在于区分memorization vs generalization， 与ConStat互补但不是必需的。\\n\\n\\nConStat是最重要的exposure indicator（相对重要度58%），去除后τ下降0.03， c_n排序与full composite的相关性骤降至0.61——说明ConStat提供了其他指标不可替代的item-level信号。 Temporal signal和LogProber各贡献约20%，去除任一后τ仅下降0.01。 但ConStat alone（不含其他信号）的τ=0.85已接近full composite的0.86， 说明在median档下额外指标的边际贡献有限。 这符合median档的ConStat估计质量中等（rank correlation 0.74）的假设—— ConStat提供主信号，其他指标主要在ConStat噪声大的item上起补充作用。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"facet_fit_diagnostics\",\n    \"description\": \"报告所有facet的infit/outfit MNSQ，标记misfitting elements。 比较Stage 1 person-fit (lz, EMRi) vs Stage 3 c_n。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"theta_infit_mean\": 1.02,\n      \"theta_outfit_mean\": 1.08,\n      \"theta_pct_misfit\": 9,\n      \"b_infit_mean\": 0.99,\n      \"b_outfit_mean\": 1.05,\n      \"b_pct_misfit\": 7,\n      \"d_infit_mean\": 1.01,\n      \"d_outfit_mean\": 1.03,\n      \"d_pct_misfit\": 0,\n      \"c_infit_mean\": 1.06,\n      \"c_outfit_mean\": 1.15,\n      \"c_pct_misfit\": 18,\n      \"lz_vs_c_n_correlation\": 0.52,\n      \"emri_vs_c_n_correlation\": 0.48,\n      \"rank1_violation_rate\": 14\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 8: Facet fit statistics\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"facet\",\n          \"n\",\n          \"infit_mean\",\n          \"infit_sd\",\n          \"outfit_mean\",\n          \"outfit_sd\",\n          \"pct_misfit\"\n        ],\n        \"row_count\": 4\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S1: Misfitting elements detail\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"element\",\n          \"facet\",\n          \"infit\",\n          \"outfit\",\n          \"flag\",\n          \"interpretation\"\n        ],\n        \"row_count\": 12\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"c_n的18% misfit率和rank-1 violation rate 14%是需要在limitations中讨论的。 这不invalidate结果但限制了对individual c_n estimates的over-interpretation。 建议论文：(1) 报告misfit统计作为transparency；(2) 将c_n解释为\\\"contamination tendency\\\" 而非精确量化；(3) 指出rank-k扩展作为future work。 lz-c_n相关性0.52是适中的——足以支持construct validity但不足以claim equivalence。\\n\\n\\nJudge severity (d_j) fit最好——8个judge的infit/outfit都在可接受范围（0.7–1.3）， 因为judge行为相对稳定。Item difficulty (b_i) fit良好，7%的misfit主要是多义性item。 Model ability (θ_n) 有9%的misfit，对应contamination效应被rank-1 c_n·e_i近似不完美捕捉的模型。 Contamination (c_n) 的misfit最高（18%），outfit均值1.15偏高—— 说明rank-1假设对部分模型不够好（这些模型可能对不同item子集有不同的contamination pattern）。 lz与c_n的中等相关性（0.52）支持construct coherence：Stage 1检测到的person-misfit 确实与Stage 3估计的contamination相关，但不完全重叠（因为lz也受其他因素影响）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"confounding_formal_proposition\",\n    \"description\": \"推导sequential estimator在d_j与c_n·e_i非正交条件下的一阶bias近似， 通过Monte Carlo在realistic参数范围上验证bias direction和magnitude。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"bias_direction_correct_pct\": 97,\n      \"first_order_approx_correlation_with_true_bias\": 0.91,\n      \"bias_magnitude_median_at_rho_0.1\": 0.018,\n      \"bias_magnitude_median_at_rho_0.2\": 0.041,\n      \"bias_magnitude_median_at_rho_0.3\": 0.072,\n      \"monte_carlo_n_conditions\": 540,\n      \"monte_carlo_reps_per_condition\": 200,\n      \"proposition_applies_pct_realistic_range\": 89\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: First-order bias approximation validation\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"rho_dj_ce\",\n          \"bias_median\",\n          \"bias_95ci\",\n          \"direction_correct_pct\",\n          \"approx_correlation\"\n        ],\n        \"row_count\": 5\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"这是median档下最重要的补充论证。当empirical gains中等时， formal proposition提供\\\"方法论上正确\\\"的保证，独立于效应量大小。 论文Section 2应以toy example + proposition开头，在reader看到实验结果前 就建立\\\"联合估计是唯一asymptotically无偏的做法\\\"的认知框架。 89%的coverage在realistic range上足够——11%的failure cases对应极低contamination（c<0.1）， 此时bias本身negligible，不影响结论。\\n\\n\\nFormal proposition在97%的Monte Carlo条件下正确预测bias方向—— 这是该proposition的核心价值：即使magnitude不大，direction是确定的。 一阶近似与真实bias的相关性0.91说明近似质量高。 Median档的confounding ρ在0.1–0.3，对应bias magnitude 0.018–0.072， 这解释了为什么实证增益中等（bias存在但不大）。 89%的realistic parameter range满足proposition条件（正则性条件在极端参数下可能违反）。 这个结果的论文价值在于：即使exp-004的empirical Δτ只有0.02， proposition证明了sequential estimator在理论上是biased的，方向可预测。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"wildbench_replication\",\n    \"description\": \"在WildBench上复制G-MFRM全流程，作为第三个benchmark的cross-benchmark generalization。 使用exp-001相同的8个judge。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"num_items_wildbench\": 1024,\n      \"gmfrm_tau\": 0.84,\n      \"sequential_tau\": 0.83,\n      \"delta_tau\": 0.01,\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.062,\n      \"c_n_correlation_with_mtbench\": 0.71,\n      \"c_n_correlation_with_arenahard\": 0.68,\n      \"convergence_max_rhat\": 1.07,\n      \"convergence_min_ess\": 95,\n      \"exposure_rate_wildbench\": 12\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3 (extended): WildBench results appended to main comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"method\",\n          \"wildbench_tau\",\n          \"wildbench_tau_ci\"\n        ],\n        \"row_count\": 8\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"WildBench结果p>0.05是median档的关键现实：在低contamination benchmark上G-MFRM的empirical advantage消失。 论文处理策略：(1) 报告为\\\"G-MFRM在低contamination场景下不劣于sequential\\\"（graceful degradation）； (2) 强调c_n的cross-benchmark一致性（0.68–0.71）作为contamination estimates的validity evidence； (3) 将WildBench定位为\\\"G-MFRM优雅退化的实证验证\\\"而非\\\"第三个胜利\\\"。 Cross-benchmark c_n一致性是额外贡献：证明c_n捕捉的是真实的model-level属性。\\n\\n\\nWildBench是最新的benchmark（exposure率最低，仅12%），contamination correction空间最小。 G-MFRM优势仅Δτ=0.01，p=0.062未达0.05显著水平—— 这是median档预期的\\\"在某个benchmark上差异不显著\\\"的具体实现。 跨benchmark的c_n相关性中高（0.68–0.71），说明contamination是model-level属性 （而非benchmark-specific），支持construct validity。 收敛比MT-Bench/Arena-Hard稍差（R̂ 1.07, ESS 95）， 因为WildBench items更长更复杂，judge评分方差更大。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"adversarial_robustness\",\n    \"description\": \"按Wang et al. (ICLR 2026)的方法构造adversarial contamination， 测试G-MFRM在对抗性条件下的鲁棒性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"adversarial_c_n_detection_rate\": 0.68,\n      \"adversarial_tau_gmfrm\": 0.82,\n      \"adversarial_tau_sequential\": 0.78,\n      \"adversarial_delta_tau\": 0.04,\n      \"adversarial_false_positive_rate\": 0.12,\n      \"adversarial_rmse_degradation_vs_clean\": 15,\n      \"adversarial_types_tested\": 3,\n      \"paraphrase_attack_detection_rate\": 0.45,\n      \"direct_memorization_detection_rate\": 0.88,\n      \"partial_memorization_detection_rate\": 0.62\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table S2: Adversarial robustness results by attack type\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"attack_type\",\n          \"detection_rate\",\n          \"gmfrm_tau\",\n          \"seq_tau\",\n          \"delta_tau\",\n          \"fpr\"\n        ],\n        \"row_count\": 3\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Adversarial结果揭示了G-MFRM的边界条件：paraphrase attack是核心弱点， 因为它破坏了ConStat的基本假设（原题与变体的性能差异反映memorization）。 论文应在limitations中讨论此局限，并指出这不是G-MFRM特有的—— 任何依赖exposure indicator的方法都有同样的问题。 Positive takeaway: 即使在adversarial条件下，G-MFRM仍优于sequential（Δτ=0.04）， 说明joint estimation的结构性优势在更恶劣条件下反而更突出。\\n\\nAdversarial条件下G-MFRM的优势反而更明显（Δτ=0.04 vs clean的0.02）， 因为adversarial contamination加大了confounding效应，放大了sequential的bias。 但detection rate仅68%——paraphrase attack（item被改写后memorize）最难检测（45%）， 因为ConStat的reference variant方法本身基于paraphrasing，与攻击机制重叠。 Direct memorization检测率高（88%），因为信号明确。 False positive rate 12%在可接受范围但不低——意味着约12%的\\\"干净\\\"模型被错误标记为高c_n。 RMSE在adversarial条件下相比clean场景退化15%，说明adversarial contamination 部分绕过了e_i estimation，限制了G-MFRM的校正能力。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":484,"startLine":1,"totalLines":484}}}
