{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XD48P8xV7ELxEQpUB2Tv6X","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tname: judge-bias-contamination-writing\n3\tdescription: LLM judge bias与contamination领域的论文叙事策略、图表设计共识——8篇深度精读蒸馏\n4\ttype: skill\n5\t---\n6\t\n7\t## 叙事类型\n8\t\n9\t\"突破局限型\"最主流（4/8：preference_leakage, ConStat, UDA, CyclicJudge），其次\"化繁为简\"（2/8）和\"统一框架\"（2/8）。G-MFRM 适合混合：\"突破局限\"论证 sequential 的 confounding，\"统一框架\"呈现 joint model。**置信度 高**\n10\t\n11\t## 开篇钩子\n12\t\n13\t**具体案例**（zheng2023 Figure 1，3/8）、**定量冲击**（CyclicJudge \">94% variance\"，3/8）、**实践脱节**（DCR，2/8）。G-MFRM 用定量冲击：lead with confounding 的 θ-RMSE degradation。**置信度 高**\n14\t\n15\t## 张力构建\n16\t\n17\t领域标准：论证现有方法有**不可修补的 structural flaw**。ConStat: \"perplexity methods fundamentally evadable\"。CyclicJudge: \"systematic bias cannot average out\"。G-MFRM 的张力：sequential pipeline 存在 identifiability problem，d_j 和 c_n·e_i confounded。**支持度 5/8，置信度 高**\n18\t\n19\t## 洞察呈现\n20\t\n21\t**Method 前的概念重构**效果最强（3/8）：ConStat Section 2 重新定义 contamination，preference_leakage Section 3 形式化 relatedness，CyclicJudge Proposition 1。G-MFRM 建议 Section 2 用 toy example 展示 confounding，Section 3 给 G-MFRM 方程。**置信度 中**\n22\t\n23\t## Figure 1\n24\t\n25\t- motivation 型最多（3/8），**problem illustration** 效果最佳（preference_leakage \"data leakage vs preference leakage\" 一图定义新概念）\n26\t- G-MFRM 建议：左 sequential pipeline（两步+confounding 标注），右 joint model（gating mechanism 高亮），颜色区分 d_j 和 c_n·e_i\n27\t\n28\t## 主结果表\n29\t\n30\t- 行=methods, 列=metrics/datasets（4/8）。judge-model 矩阵在 bias 研究常见（CyclicJudge, UDA）\n31\t- **Highlight**: bold_best（4/8），颜色编码（preference_leakage 蓝紫背景最创新），bold+underline_second（CyclicJudge）\n32\t- **统计**: mean ± CI/std（3/8），bootstrap 显著性在 contamination 论文是标准\n33\t- **Baselines**: 5-10 个\n34\t- G-MFRM 主表：行=4 methods，列=ρ levels × metrics，mean ± std ≥20 seeds + Wilcoxon p\n35\t\n36\t## 消融表\n37\t\n38\tfull numbers 占绝对主流（6/8），checkmark grid 在此领域不常见。建议 G-MFRM：row=components (gating/judge facet/contamination facet on/off)，full numbers。**置信度 高**\n39\t\n40\t## 图的叙事节奏\n41\t\n42\t典型：motivation → method → main result → mechanism。CyclicJudge: 策略对比 → bias heatmap。ConStat: workflow → quantification scatter (r²=0.94)。G-MFRM 建议：概念图 → 方法 → θ-RMSE vs ρ → 参数恢复 scatter/heatmap。\n43\t\n44\t## 图表分工\n45\t\n46\t- **图**: variance/trend→line plot, correlation→scatter, bias 结构→heatmap\n47\t- **表**: precision numbers (accuracy/detection rate), ablation\n48\t- **附录**: full matrices, robustness checks, prompts。主文保持 2-5 tables + 2-5 figures\n49\t- **支持度 6/8，置信度 高**\n50\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a57f7a91-5608-4b5c-b6a3-f3e4a88c0472","uuid":"065bb7fb-e441-4365-8a28-2c8e7444e6a8","timestamp":"2026-05-21T21:07:07.304Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-prod43/skills/projects/gated_mfrm_judge_bias/distilled-writing.skill.md","content":"---\nname: judge-bias-contamination-writing\ndescription: LLM judge bias与contamination领域的论文叙事策略、图表设计共识——8篇深度精读蒸馏\ntype: skill\n---\n\n## 叙事类型\n\n\"突破局限型\"最主流（4/8：preference_leakage, ConStat, UDA, CyclicJudge），其次\"化繁为简\"（2/8）和\"统一框架\"（2/8）。G-MFRM 适合混合：\"突破局限\"论证 sequential 的 confounding，\"统一框架\"呈现 joint model。**置信度 高**\n\n## 开篇钩子\n\n**具体案例**（zheng2023 Figure 1，3/8）、**定量冲击**（CyclicJudge \">94% variance\"，3/8）、**实践脱节**（DCR，2/8）。G-MFRM 用定量冲击：lead with confounding 的 θ-RMSE degradation。**置信度 高**\n\n## 张力构建\n\n领域标准：论证现有方法有**不可修补的 structural flaw**。ConStat: \"perplexity methods fundamentally evadable\"。CyclicJudge: \"systematic bias cannot average out\"。G-MFRM 的张力：sequential pipeline 存在 identifiability problem，d_j 和 c_n·e_i confounded。**支持度 5/8，置信度 高**\n\n## 洞察呈现\n\n**Method 前的概念重构**效果最强（3/8）：ConStat Section 2 重新定义 contamination，preference_leakage Section 3 形式化 relatedness，CyclicJudge Proposition 1。G-MFRM 建议 Section 2 用 toy example 展示 confounding，Section 3 给 G-MFRM 方程。**置信度 中**\n\n## Figure 1\n\n- motivation 型最多（3/8），**problem illustration** 效果最佳（preference_leakage \"data leakage vs preference leakage\" 一图定义新概念）\n- G-MFRM 建议：左 sequential pipeline（两步+confounding 标注），右 joint model（gating mechanism 高亮），颜色区分 d_j 和 c_n·e_i\n\n## 主结果表\n\n- 行=methods, 列=metrics/datasets（4/8）。judge-model 矩阵在 bias 研究常见（CyclicJudge, UDA）\n- **Highlight**: bold_best（4/8），颜色编码（preference_leakage 蓝紫背景最创新），bold+underline_second（CyclicJudge）\n- **统计**: mean ± CI/std（3/8），bootstrap 显著性在 contamination 论文是标准\n- **Baselines**: 5-10 个\n- G-MFRM 主表：行=4 methods，列=ρ levels × metrics，mean ± std ≥20 seeds + Wilcoxon p\n\n## 消融表\n\nfull numbers 占绝对主流（6/8），checkmark grid 在此领域不常见。建议 G-MFRM：row=components (gating/judge facet/contamination facet on/off)，full numbers。**置信度 高**\n\n## 图的叙事节奏\n\n典型：motivation → method → main result → mechanism。CyclicJudge: 策略对比 → bias heatmap。ConStat: workflow → quantification scatter (r²=0.94)。G-MFRM 建议：概念图 → 方法 → θ-RMSE vs ρ → 参数恢复 scatter/heatmap。\n\n## 图表分工\n\n- **图**: variance/trend→line plot, correlation→scatter, bias 结构→heatmap\n- **表**: precision numbers (accuracy/detection rate), ablation\n- **附录**: full matrices, robustness checks, prompts。主文保持 2-5 tables + 2-5 figures\n- **支持度 6/8，置信度 高**\n","numLines":50,"startLine":1,"totalLines":50}}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01EjbgUwNp6vCYxjAB6ZFCdW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have all the context needed. Let me also check what LaTeX packages/templates are available on the system.\n\nLet me write the full paper now. I need to create a complete LaTeX document covering all 10 experiments in the experiment_data.json:\n\n1. multi_judge_data_collection\n2. constat_exposure_estimation\n3. gmfrm_real_data_fit\n4. baseline_comparison\n5. contamination_magnitude_calibration\n6. judge_count_sensitivity\n7. exposure_indicator_ablation\n8. facet_fit_diagnostics\n\n\n9. confounding_formal_proposition\n10. wildbench_replication\n\nLet me organize these into a coherent paper structure with sections for abstract, introduction, background with the formal proposition and toy example, the G-MFRM three-stage method, and then experiments grouped by purpose: data collection and exposure estimation setup, baseline comparisons, model fit diagnostics, contamination analysis, sensitivity analyses, and the replication study.\n\nThe key narrative should emphasize how the framework unifies different approaches while improving interpretability, highlight that joint estimation is methodologically sound through asymptotic arguments, and show that per-model contamination estimates offer independent value. I want to stress that G-MFRM gracefully reduces to standard MFRM when contamination is negligible, and that real-world contamination levels are moderate rather than extreme, with confounding present but less dramatic than synthetic scenarios suggest.\n\nNow I'm checking the statistical significance across benchmarks more carefully. MT-Bench and Arena-Hard both show significant improvements for G-MFRM over the best baselines, while WildBench falls just short of significance. This pattern matters for the narrative—I have two strong wins and one borderline result to work with.\n\nI need to write the paper now, keeping in mind the specific constraints: no em-dashes, no -ing phrase endings, no AI-style language, and using booktabs for tables. All the numbers have to come from the experiment data, nothing made up. The venue is EMNLP 2026, so I'll structure it accordingly.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8948,"cache_read_input_tokens":34876,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8948},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a57f7a91-5608-4b5c-b6a3-f3e4a88c0472","uuid":"e8b1d223-8898-4382-9754-472d07cc05dc"}
